00:21:11.850 --> 00:21:14.670
I knew I was setting her up for a great reaction.

452
00:21:14.930 --> 00:21:16.490
And that's always fun to do.

453
00:21:16.670 --> 00:21:20.750
I thought the other brilliant thing about it, Ange, was that you were also setting up

454
00:21:20.750 --> 00:21:22.430
the world beyond the conference room.

455
00:21:23.310 --> 00:21:26.310
I mean, you knew it was empty out there.

456
00:21:26.350 --> 00:21:26.670
Oh, yeah.

457
00:21:26.810 --> 00:21:28.070
But you were filling it in.

458
00:21:28.470 --> 00:21:31.250
It was nice to imagine that Michael was in his office.

459
00:21:31.850 --> 00:21:32.210
Oh, yeah.

460
00:21:32.610 --> 00:21:33.130
Thank you.

461
00:21:33.350 --> 00:21:33.650
Mm-hmm.

462
00:21:34.050 --> 00:21:37.750
Well, Oscar's going to have a talking head where he said it's probably Michael

