00:21:37.750 --> 00:21:40.950
because every time money has gone missing, it's been Michael's fault.

464
00:21:41.150 --> 00:21:45.790
I love that he says he goes out with, like, clients for lunch, and then it's a $50 receipt

465
00:21:45.790 --> 00:21:46.410
to J.Crew.

466
00:21:47.630 --> 00:21:50.270
I'm surprised to find out that Michael shops at J.Crew.

467
00:21:50.470 --> 00:21:51.690
Oh, that is true.

468
00:21:52.150 --> 00:21:55.970
Oscar and Angela both say, you know, listen, we've gone over our books so many times.

469
00:21:56.450 --> 00:21:57.790
There's not an accounting error.

